  "body": "## Bathcat intake-gap report\n\n- Stable intake slug: `gloomhaven`\n- BGG ID: `174430`\n- Cohort attempted: `solo_rpg`\n- Scope: released physical base game; exact printing not frozen because governing rules evidence was not retrievable.\n\n### Shortfall\nThe candidate did not meet `ready_for_audit`. The official core rulebook was not retrieved from an official endpoint, so the bounded governing-document inventory cannot be closed. No packet or canonical tree was created. Independent reception and meaningful visual receipts were not completed after the primary-rules gate failed.\n\n### Attempted sources and outcomes\n- Wishlist lead: `WISHLIST.md`, Gloomhaven monster ability decks.\n- Identity lead: https://boardgamegeek.com/boardgame/174430/gloomhaven \u2014 discovery only; not used as official rules evidence.\n- Official publisher page: https://cephalofair.com/pages/gloomhaven \u2014 direct retrieval returned HTTP 429 (`text/plain`, 18 bytes); no official rulebook file was acquired.\n- Candidate publisher CDN path: https://cephalofair.com/cdn/shop/files/Gloomhaven_Rulebook.pdf \u2014 HTTP 404; no usable receipt.\n\n### Help requested\nProvide an official or authorized exact-edition core rulebook URL and confirm whether the scope is the base game or a specific printing. After that, retrieve an independent review outside Cephalofair and BGG plus at least two meaningful source-linked visuals from permitted sources.\n\nThis is a research gap, not an infrastructure failure.",
